# 🟢 LAB 10 – Network Watcher

Enable:

```bash
az network watcher configure \
  --locations centralindia \
  --enabled true
```

Check connectivity:

```bash
az network watcher test-connectivity \
  --source-resource vm-public \
  --dest-address 8.8.8.8 \
  --dest-port 80 \
  --resource-group rg-vnet-lab
```

